%LCKihee
%LC喜兵卫
\dOh, so you're making these from scratch?\d%K%P
「喔，手制的吗」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dIt's not that hard.\nI'm just melting store-bought chocolate and coagulating it\nagain.\d%K%P
「也不是那么费时费力的事啦。\n等做点心用的巧克力溶化了，再等它凝固下来就好了」%K%P
%LCKihee
%LC喜兵卫
\d...It looks quite a bit more complicated to me, though.\nThese are... oh, chocolate chip cookies, yes?\d%K%P
「…就算这样，不也是很花费工夫么。\n这是…喔，这不是巧克力饼干么」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dMr. Retired, here. Try this. Say \dahh\d.\d%K%P
「老爷子，来尝尝。\n啊～嗯」%K%P
%LCKihee
%LC喜兵卫
\dMgh... nm, I see your skills haven't waned a whit, Young\nMistress.\d%K%P
「唔咕………嗯～，你还是这么手巧啊，小房东」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dReally? You don't think it's too sweet, do you?\nI thought I might have added too much sugar.\d%K%P
「是么？是不是太甜了？\n我估摸着原料的量也许放错了」%K%P
%LCKihee
%LC喜兵卫
\dNot at all. The fragrant cookie dough mixes with the\nbitterness of the chocolate in perfect fashion... Khh, I\nwish I could have a drink with this!\d%K%P
「没有没有，香醇的饼干，\n和略微有些苦味的巧克力搭配在一起…\n呜～啊，我都想喝两杯了！」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\d...It's not spicy or anything, is it?\d%K%P
「………太咸了？」%K%P
%LCKihee
%LC喜兵卫
\dI'm honestly surprised you managed to get so good at your\nage. You're going be one enviable bride in a couple of\nyears.\d%K%P
「说真的啊，\n你年纪轻轻，手艺就如此高了啊。\n将来一定是个好媳妇儿啊」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\d...A couple of years?\d%K%P
「…将来？」%K%P
%LCKihee
%LC喜兵卫
\dAbsolutely. I'm certain you'll be a striking beauty in\nyour twenties, unable to escape the attention of countless\nsuitors.\d%K%P
「啊～，对啊！\n到了二十岁的时候，你一定会成为一个大美女，\n周围的年轻小伙们都会围着你转，很不得了啊…」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dThat's... too long...\d%K%P
「太遥远了吧…」%K%P
%LCKihee
%LC喜兵卫
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
...%K%P
………%K%P
%LCKihee
%LC喜兵卫
\dHmm. I see you're not going to lack in repertoire.\d%K%P
「嘿，真是准备了不少啊」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dTruffles, chocolate with nuts, some with fruit...\nI mean, it's Valentine's. A day I can express my gratitude\nto everyone.\d%K%P
「松露、松果加进去，还有水果…\n嘛，毕竟是情人节，要饱含着感谢之情嘛～」%K%P
%LCKihee
%LC喜兵卫
\d...What about that complicated-looking chocolate cake\nthat half of the ingredients seem to have gone into?\d%K%P
「…那，这边气势如虹、使用了一半材料做成的巧克力是？」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
%LCKihee
%LC喜兵卫
\dI see, so that's for the Young Master.\n...You needn't be so obvious, you know.\d%K%P
「这是给小少爷的吧？\n…其他任何一样都没有如此明显的偏爱啊」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dOsamu hasn't been home in ages.\nI was worried he might be suffering from malnutrition.\d%K%P
「理君，最近没有回来。\n说不定营养失调了…」%K%P
%LCKihee
%LC喜兵卫
\dYou want to supplement his nutrition with chocolate...?\nYou realize he's not lost in the mountains, right?\d%K%P
「巧克力用于补充营养…\n这可真是不得了啊？」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dWhat's your problem today, Mr. Retired?\nI'll let you have one more taste, so stop getting in my\nhair.\d%K%P
「老爷子，您的话可真多…\n再让你尝一个，就不要再说了！」%K%P
%LCKihee
%LC喜兵卫
\dMgh... hmhm... strawberries go perfectly with this...\d%K%P
「唔咕…呼呼呼呼…草莓也不错嘛」%K%P
...%K%P
………%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dOkay... I guess I'm done with this.\d%K%P
「好了…这样就准备好了」%K%P
%LCKihee
%LC喜兵卫
\d...Um, Young Mistress.\d%K%P
「…我说，小房东」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dHm? What?\nGimme a sec, I'm writing down a message.\d%K%P
「嗯～，什么事？\n现在我在和别人联系，稍等一下…」%K%P
%LCKihee
%LC喜兵卫
\dI admit that the Young Master is a fine man.\d%K%P
「小少爷他，的确他是个好人啊」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
%LCKihee
%LC喜兵卫
\dHe never forgets a debt, and would spend his entire life\nto repay it, if need be. You don't see people that\nprincipled anymore in this day and age -- a genuinely\nvirtuous man.\d%K%P
「知恩图报。\n滴水之恩，他会当涌泉相报。\n在如今的后生小子里，是个恩义的好人啊」%K%P
%LCKihee
%LC喜兵卫
\d...Hmm, I suppose I'm praising him a bit too much.\nLet's change that \dman\d part into \duncle\d at least.\d%K%P
「…呀，我夸他有点儿过头了啊。\n应该改个说法，是如今的『大叔』」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dIs -that- what you wanted to fix?\d%K%P
「为什么要订正那里？」%K%P
%LCKihee
%LC喜兵卫
\dLast year, you saved him. He'll never forget that debt,\nand will do everything he can for you.\d%K%P
「小房东，你一年前拯救了小少爷。\n所以，这份恩情他不会忘记，\n一定会为你赴汤蹈火，在所不辞」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dBut I didn't do anything.\nWell, nothing that could be considered a debt.\d%K%P
「我，没那么做过吧。\n我不记得，对理君有什么恩惠了…」%K%P
%LCKihee
%LC喜兵卫
\dBut that's exactly the point...\nSince he's unable to forget the past...\d%K%P
「可是，正是如此…\n正因为对过去的种种总是忘不掉…」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\d...It's okay. You don't need to say it.\d%K%P
「哎…\n够了，不要再说了」%K%P
%LCKihee
%LC喜兵卫
\d...he might not be able to choose you.\d%K%P
「他或许，不会选择你哦？」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dI told you to shut up...\d%K%P
「我都说了不要再说了…」%K%P
%LCKihee
%LC喜兵卫
\dHe might find himself unable to leave his wife.\d%K%P
「夫人…他或许不会抛弃夫人哦？」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
%LCKihee
%LC喜兵卫
\dLook, Young Mistress. I think of you as one of my own\ngrandchildren, in no way different from my six real ones.\d%K%P
「呐，小房东。\n我啊，一直把你当做孙女来看待。\n你啊，和我６个真正的孙辈差不多呢」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dI know... And I think of you as my grandpa, too. You\ndon't give me an allowance, and you're sometimes late with\nrent, but...\d%K%P
「嗯…\n我也把老爷子，当做爷爷来看待。\n虽然没有零花钱。还经常拖欠房租…」%K%P
%LCKihee
%LC喜兵卫
\dI'm sorry, Young Mistress... um... Mitoko.\d%K%P
「抱歉啊，小房东…不，美都子」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dIt's okay. I was just kidding about the rent.\d%K%P
「得了得了，房租先不提了」%K%P
%LCKihee
%LC喜兵卫
\dI'm sorry for not being able to unconditionally cheer you\non, like a real grandpa could have.\d%K%P
「孙女认真的感情，\n我没法无条件地支持，抱歉啊」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\d...?! What... are you talking about...?\d%K%P
「…\n是…什么事呢」%K%P
%LCKihee
%LC喜兵卫
\dI'm sorry for not being the grandpa who indulges his\ngrandchildren at the cost of upsetting their parents.\d%K%P
「太骄纵孙女，以至于都被她训斥了，\n我真是个没用的爷爷，抱歉啊」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
%LCKihee
%LC喜兵卫
\dMitoko... You and the Young Master... It's...\d%K%P
「美都子…\n你和小少爷果然还是…」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\d...I'm done.\d%K%P
「…成功了」%K%P
%LCKihee
%LC喜兵卫
\dUh?\d%K%P
「嗯？」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dLook, it's done, Mr. Retired! A super deluxe Valentine\nCake with Toko's exclusive handwritten message of love, to\nboot!\d%K%P
「成功了，您看，老爷子。\n超豪华的情人节蛋糕！\n这是都子亲笔写下的爱之宣言！」%K%P
%LCKihee
%LC喜兵卫
\dMitoko... I would rather we finished our conversation...\d%K%P
「美都子。\n比起现在的这个，我的话…」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dI think you should look at this instead.\nJust look! It came out so well!\d%K%P
「这可比那个重要啊。\n好了，看看吧！我做得不错吧？」%K%P
%LCKihee
%LC喜兵卫
\dW-Wait! Hey! .........Ah.\d%K%P
「等、等等，喂………啊」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dIt conveys my feelings, doesn't it?\nI think it does, if I do say so myself.\d%K%P
「我的爱恋…能传达到吧？\n能传达到吧？」%K%P
%LCKihee
%LC喜兵卫
\dMitoko... you...\d%K%P
「美都子…你…」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dI love Osamu. He could be in love with any other woman,\nand my feelings still wouldn't change one bit.\d%K%P
「因为我…最爱理君了。\n就算他爱上了别人，恋上了别人，\n我的感情，我的思念，我的爱，也不会变化…」%K%P
%LCKihee
%LC喜兵卫
\dI see, so that's how it is... Hm. How tough, how sad that\nmust have been for you.\d%K%P
「是吗，是吗…嗯嗯。\n太辛酸了啊，太悲伤了啊」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dMr. Retired... Grandpa...!!\d%K%P
「老爷子…爷爷！」%K%P
%LCKihee
%LC喜兵卫
\dYou really pulled through. I'm proud of you, missy.\d%K%P
「真是…忍耐很久了啊。\n很了不起，嗯」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dI mean... I just can't... I can't bear the thought of\nOsamu being like this! I don't want him to suffer...!!\d%K%P
「因为，因为…\n我果然是，不想看到他的愁容…\n不想让他心情愁苦啊」%K%P
%LCKihee
%LC喜兵卫
\dMitoko... you truly are the kindest girl in the whole\nwide world. If you won't take the Young Master's word for\nit, then take mine. I can guarantee it just the same.\d%K%P
「美都子…你果真是，世界上最好的姑娘了。\n不只是小少爷，这一点我也可以保证啊」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dUah, uah, uah... uaaaaaah...\nUeeeehh... uaaaaaaahhh...!\d%K%P
「呜、呜、呜…呜啊啊啊啊啊～啊、\n呜啊啊啊啊啊啊啊、呜啊啊啊啊啊啊～啊」%K%P
